   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Say goodbye to cold, painful pumping and endless dishwashing! 🙅‍♀️✨\nMomcozy Wellness 1 combines 360° soothing Warmth & 5-zone Massage with ultra-easy cleanup: Only 5 parts to wash and a quick One-Press Release! 🧼 \nLess time scrubbing, more time relaxing. 🌸\n👉 Tap the link for details and easy checkout on Amazon! 🛍️",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuMGgT9p2zx/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Say goodbye to cold, painful pumping and endless dishwashing! 🙅‍♀️✨\nMomcozy Wellness 1 combines 360° soothing Warmth & 5-zone Massage with ultra-easy cleanup: Only 5 parts to wash and a quick One-Press Release! 🧼 \nLess time scrubbing, more time relaxing. 🌸\n👉 Tap the link for details and easy checkout on Amazon! 🛍️",
